"| Hbar           | a H with a horizontal bar above it                    |\n"
"| 2              | squared                                               |\n"
"| 3              | to the power of three                                 |\n"
"| /2             | 1/2                                                   |\n"
"| partial        | partial sign (the d of dx/dt)                         |\n"
